abstract: >-
  The experiments, committed artifacts, claim ledger and technical report behind olmoearth-inferencex 1.12.1. The
  methods are evaluated on the 24 tasks of Ai2's published embedding suite across 16 encoders; each recorded result is
  linked to a committed artifact and re-checked against it by the test suite.
